00:04:45.836 --> 00:04:48.548
<v Host>It means a standard or criterion.

00:04:49.148 --> 00:04:58.435
<v Slow>降格の心配がなくなるため、クラブは長期的な投資がしやすくなります。

00:04:59.235 --> 00:05:04.851
<v Host>With no fear of relegation, clubs can invest for the long term more easily.

